@base = http://localhost:8080
@account = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@operation = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Register; repeat with the same key and body to get 200 instead of 201
POST {{base}}/api/v1/operations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

{"accountId":"{{account}}","amount":125.50,"currency":"EUR","description":"Invoice INV-1042"}

### Operation from seed.sql; replace operation with the id from registration if needed
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operation}}

### Account history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations?accountId={{account}}&size=20&page=0

### Start processing
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operation}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PROCESSING","reason":"Accepted by processor"}

### Cancel a NEW operation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operation}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Customer request"}

### Status journal
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operation}}/history

### Allowed transitions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operation}}/transitions

### Summary
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/summary?accountId={{account}}
